<p>Use the figures above, which show the functions <m>f(x)</m> and <m>g(x)</m>,
to find the following values. Note that you can find exact values.</p>
<p><alert>1.</alert> <m>f(g(-5))</m>=<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>2.</alert> <m>g(f(0))</m>=<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert>3.</alert> <m>g(g(-4))</m>=<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>3</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-0.75</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
