    <solution><alert>1.</alert>
<m>f(g(-5)) = f(-0.75)</m> which is <m>3</m>.




<alert>2.</alert>
<m>g(f(0)) = g(3)</m> which is <m>-0.75</m>.




<alert>3.</alert>
<m>g(g(-4)) = g(0)</m> which is <m>1.5</m>.



